              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mugizi gwu mugati, keng'oze chaali mu ichahambanywa ni kirivwa chu mugati kolovega lwi Ivaale. Keng'oze yiki chazizaa mu keng'oze chu muvwingiliru ichaali kolovega lwu mugizi. Hene yaho vogizilaho vihaanwa via vasamba kuli visiuviliru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
