          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugati mwi keng'oze, zialimu zimesa zine, na ichova wu mugizi kandi zialiyo zimesa zine. Ziosi harara ziali zimesa munane ziavasinziraku zinyama zia vahaana kuva kuli kisiuviriru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ziali mu kandi ni zimesa zine iziavazwa kutura ku magina. Zimesa yizi ziali ziokolomberaku vihaanwa viu kusambwa. Ziali zisendimita 50 kuzia igulu, nu vwaliru vwazio vwali zisendimita makomi saba na zitano zimbega ziosi. Viju viosi viavatumikiraa kwita visiuviliru viavikwa kwene yiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
