          "text": "Mundu uyu yaagera mugizi gwu mugati, na gwaali zimita 50 zimbega ziosi. Litembeli liali kolovega lwi madioli, nu uvwali vwali imbiri wa lio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
